        "8536ea09-27ac-4235-a508-cb7622f01539": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Monthlies, we understand that menstrual care is not one-size-fits-all. Start your journey by taking our quiz, designed to provide personalised guidance, daily habit tips, and product suggestions from female experts who truly understand.<br/><br/><strong>Our Pledge to You:<br/></strong><br/><strong>✓</strong> Customised, Expert Guidance: We'll be with you every step of the way, offering advice tailored to your unique needs.<br/><br/><strong>✓ </strong>Personalised, Natural, and Premium Quality Products: We select only the finest natural formulations, curated just for you.<br/><br/><strong>✓</strong> Reliable Pain Relief: Our solutions work, and you can depend on them when you need them most.<br/><br/><strong>✓ </strong>Outstanding Customer Service and Fast Shipping: Your satisfaction is our priority. We're here to serve you with quick responses and speedy deliveries</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": true
          }
        }
      },
